### The Root Cause
Your system supports two formats: the **System Format** (14 columns) and the **Standard Format** (7 columns).
When you uploaded your Standard Format Excel file, the Branch code in your very first column happened to be "1".
Inside your JournalBulkValidationService.java, the parser checks the first column (col0) to decide which format it is reading. Because your branch code was "1", this if statement triggered:
```java
